{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S05等短停留段落的静态感受词偏密，容易让人来不及消化；个别地方也加入了X没有明确表达的心理判断。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用【】突出每段叙事的关键落点，感受字缩小，且部分感受随音乐到时出现，观众可以先抓住人物正在经历什么，再顺着音乐接收细节。它对呼吸、温度、身体摇荡、音色变化和情绪转折的描写更具体，反复出现的水波、小船等意象也增强了前后呼应。X的完整句子在解释人物动机和因果关系上略胜一筹，但整体而言，Y更容易让普通观众在听音乐的同时既跟上故事，又感受到音乐与心理变化之间的细微联系。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c397d2a9-a913-4946-b0fc-845a6ee90d16", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T182307001876Z", "elapsed_seconds": 113.453, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T18:25:00.470069+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "54d33c57b2bab88fc0184542c611b41605129ef8d6da93ea4b0355cce155d6b0", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\